[["ಒಡೆಯರಿಗೆ ಒಡವೆಯನೊಪ್ಪಿಸಲಾರದೆ ಮೊರೆುಡುವ ಮನವ ನಾನೇನೆಂಬೆ ನೆತ್ತಿಯಲ್ಲಿ… (Oḍeyarige oḍaveyanoppisalārade more ḍuva manava nānēneṃbe nettiyalli…)","Basavanna","basavanna/376"],["ದುವ್ರ್ಯಸನಿ ದುರಾಚಾರಿ ಎಂದೆನಿಸದಿರಯ್ಯಾ (Duvryasani durācāri eṃdenisadirayyā)","Basavanna","basavanna/631"],["Ceann Duv Dilis","Anonymous (Irish Gaelic, later)","anonymous-irish-gaelic/104"],["Sven Duva","Johan Ludvig Runeberg","runeberg/106"],["Duvan och örnen","Erik Axel Karlfeldt","erik-axel-karlfeldt/75"]]